### Expensio Enterprise API Testing Suite (.http / REST Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

### =========================================================================
### 1. HEALTH & METRICS
### =========================================================================

### 1.1 Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health


### =========================================================================
### 2. PHASE 1: AUTHENTICATION
### =========================================================================

### 2.1 Email Signup
# @name signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/email/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ishita.developer@expensio.app",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "name": "Ishita Katiyar"
}

### 2.2 Verify Email OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/verification/email/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "challengeId": "{{signup.response.body.data.challengeId}}",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 2.3 Mobile OTP Start (Dispatches SMS via Twilio / Dev Simulation)
# @name mobileStart
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/mobile/otp/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+919876543210"
}

### 2.4 Verify Mobile OTP & Login
# @name mobileLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/mobile/login/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "challengeId": "{{mobileStart.response.body.data.challengeId}}",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 2.5 Email Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/email/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ishita.developer@expensio.app",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

### 2.6 Google OAuth Login (Dev Mock / Live Token)
# @name googleLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "mock_google_ishita_dev"
}

### 2.7 Refresh Token Rotation
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.data.refreshToken}}"
}


### =========================================================================
### 3. PHASE 2: USER ONBOARDING SYSTEM
### =========================================================================

### 3.1 Get Onboarding Configuration (Publicly accessible)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/onboarding/config

### 3.2 Get Onboarding Progress & Status (Requires Onboarding or App Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/onboarding/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 3.3 Update Profile (Name & Verified Contacts)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/onboarding/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Demo",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "demo.developer@expensio.app",
  "phone": "+919876543210"
}

### 3.4 Update Employment Details (Supported: SALARIED, BUSINESS, STUDENT, RETIRED, HOMEMAKER)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/onboarding/employment
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employmentType": "SALARIED",
  "monthlyIncomeMinor": 8500000,
  "currency": "INR"
}

### 3.5 Update Initial Financial Profile (Non-negative balances in minor units)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/onboarding/financial-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cashBalanceMinor": 2500000,
  "savingsBalanceMinor": 10000000,
  "currency": "INR"
}

### 3.6 Complete Onboarding (Generates unique username, activates account, issues full session)
# @name completeOnboarding
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/onboarding/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}


### =========================================================================
### 4. PHASE 4: USER & SESSION MANAGEMENT (Full APPLICATION token required)
### =========================================================================

### 4.1 Get Authenticated User Profile & Full Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{completeOnboarding.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 4.2 Update Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{completeOnboarding.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ishita",
  "lastName": "Katiyar"
}

### 4.3 Update Username (Custom alphanumeric username, checks reserved words & records history)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/v1/users/me/username
Authorization: Bearer {{completeOnboarding.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ishita_pro"
}

### 4.4 Logout Single Device
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{completeOnboarding.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{completeOnboarding.response.body.data.refreshToken}}"
}

### 4.4 Logout All Devices
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{completeOnboarding.response.body.data.accessToken}}

